  "keyFeatures": [
    "22 composable documentation skills covering the complete software lifecycle",
    "Orchestrator skill (`using-engineering-docs`) that auto-routes from raw idea to full document set",
    "Greenfield and brownfield mode detection — new projects vs. adding features to existing codebases",
    "Tool-call interview mechanism — one question at a time, never repeats answered context",
    "Cross-document consistency checks — entity names, roles, and decisions verified across all documents",
    "Compatible with 14+ AI agents: Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Goose, Pi, Cline, Roo Code, and more",
    "Standards-aligned output: ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148, C4 Model, STRIDE, Google SRE, OpenAPI 3.1, MADR",
    "MCP server integration for programmatic document validation and index generation",
    "Session-persistent progress tracking via `.engineering-docs/index.md`",
    "CLI installer (`npx engineering-docs`) with per-agent target flags"
  ],
